<pending_commit branch="master" change_id="I352e7e4466494ca7ca0b13b69a2853f868303d0f" commit="4e481de3272834697b7a37ebe85356dbeeb0d50d" commit_message="hwid/service: Deploy HWID Service with local snapshot.  After adding HWID Service proxy to HWID Service on GKE, we found that it is more convenient to running it with a local snapshot than pulling from ToT periodically.  There are some reasons: 1. It's easier to deploy the latest patches to both AppEngine    and ContainerEngine at the same time. 2. Since there are no many changes for HWID code base every day,    it is more stable than pulling codes from ToT everyday. 3. Comparing to code base on google3, the deployment process of the    AppEngine and ContainerEngine is relatively easy, just need one    command, we don't really need to let it constantly fetching latest    codes.  TEST=manually BUG=b:69987557  Change-Id: I352e7e4466494ca7ca0b13b69a2853f868303d0f Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/818600 Commit-Ready: Yilun Lin &lt;yllin@chromium.org&gt; Tested-by: Yilun Lin &lt;yllin@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Yilun Lin &lt;yllin@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Ting Shen &lt;phoenixshen@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="818600" owner_email="yllin@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="4" project="chromiumos/platform/factory" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/factory" ref="refs/changes/00/818600/4" remote="cros" total_fail_count="0"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="Ica72c1fbadd9ec6aa6d08a8abfa37bf12b416ce2" commit="3c388f778fbc3fddde1f91f6e1b4243ab171d0bc" commit_message="hwid/service: Deprecate service_manager.  Since we only deploy local snapshot on HWID Service now, we don't need service_manager.  TEST=manually BUG=b:69987557  Change-Id: Ica72c1fbadd9ec6aa6d08a8abfa37bf12b416ce2 Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/818601 Commit-Ready: Yilun Lin &lt;yllin@chromium.org&gt; Tested-by: Yilun Lin &lt;yllin@chromium.